- **Database**: PostgreSQL {{ postgres_version }} on `localhost:{{ postgres_port }}` (`postgres{{ service_suffix }}.service`), user/pass `{{ db_user }}/{{ db_password }}`; each session's DB is `wt_<slug>_<MMDDYY>`, a restore of the prod dump in `backup/`
- **Odoo credentials** (sessions): `admin` / `admin`{% if tickets_mcp == 'odoo' %}. Production is reached through the claude.ai Odoo connector, signed in as you{% endif %}

{% else %}
- **Database**: PostgreSQL {{ postgres_version }} — `{{ db_name }}` on `localhost:{{ postgres_port }}`, user/pass `{{ db_user }}/{{ db_password }}`
- **Odoo HTTP**: `localhost:{{ odoo_http_port }}`, {% if odoo_major | int >= 17 %}gevent{% else %}longpolling{% endif %} `localhost:{{ odoo_gevent_port }}`, nginx proxy `localhost:{{ nginx_port }}`
